Warnings: 0

Kernel Warnings: 0

Errors: 0

Boot result: FAIL

Kernel Errors: 0



But from the the kernelci main page below, it didn=92t show those failures.

I guess they were categorized as =91Unknown=92 issues. However, even those =
failures were marked as =93Unknown=94 issues, another problem is that users=
 has no way to

Quickly filter out those =91Unknown=92 issues because the =91Unknown=92 but=
ton is grey.

Can you help check those two issues and report to kernelci if it can be imp=
roved?



https://kernelci.org/soc/imx/job/next/kernel/next-20200911/plan/baseline/

